    "finalMessage": "Built the notifications inbox in `src/screens/Screen.tsx` with styles in `src/screens/Screen.module.css`, using Strata components (`Badge`, `Button`, `IconTile`, `ToggleButtonGroup`, `Separator`) and icons for each type.\n\n- 8 mock notifications grouped into **Today** (4) and **Earlier** (4), spanning all four types.\n- Unread items get a highlighted background, a dot, and a bold title.\n- \"Mark as read\" per item, \"Mark all as read\" (disabled when nothing's unread), and a segmented filter (All/Payment/Security/Policy/Reminder) that filters both groups, with an empty state if a filter yields nothing.\n- Used CSS logical properties and Strata design tokens so it holds up across brands, light/dark, and RTL."
